    <div class="cards3">
      <div class="card3"><div class="num">1</div><h3>It matches your skin</h3><p>The fatty acids in grass-fed tallow are close to the ones in human skin. Your face recognizes it and absorbs it fast — no greasy film.</p></div>
      <div class="card3"><div class="num">2</div><h3>It repairs overnight</h3><p>Raw manuka honey calms inflammation and helps skin recover while you sleep. That's the "less angry by morning" effect.</p></div>
      <div class="card3"><div class="num">3</div><h3>It balances oil</h3><p>Jojoba oil signals your skin to stop overproducing. Shiny forehead, dry cheeks — it helps both from the same jar.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

