  <div class="inner">
    <p class="overline" style="text-align:center">Straight Answers</p>
    <h2>The Questions Guys Actually Ask</h2>
    <div class="faq" style="margin-top:24px">
      <div class="faqi" data-faq><button class="faqi__q" data-faq-trig>Does it smell like beef?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faqi__a"><p>No. The unscented jar has a faint natural note that disappears within a minute. No cologne, no fragrance, nothing anyone will notice across the dinner table.</p></div></div>
