      <div class="faqi" data-faq><button class="faqi__q" data-faq-trig>What if it doesn't work for me?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faqi__a"><p>Email us within 60 days for a full refund — even if the jar's empty. You use it, and if it's not for you, the risk is on us, not you.</p></div></div>
